{'symbol': 'BLK', 'date': '2020-05-13 00:30:00', 'title': 'BLACKROCK ANNOUNCES PRICING OF SECONDARY OFFERING OF COMMON STOCK', 'text': 'BLACKROCK ANNOUNCES PRICING OF SECONDARY OFFERING OF COMMON STOCK.BLACKROCK - PRICING OF SECONDARY OFFERING OF 28,753,248 SHARES OF COMMON STOCK HELD BY PNC FINANCIAL SERVICES GROUP AT A PRICE OF $420 PER SHARE.BLACKROCK INC - AGREED TO PURCHASE ABOUT 2.7 MILLION SHARES DIRECTLY FROM PNC, AT PRICE OF $414.96 PER SHARE FOR AGGREGATE PURCHASE AMOUNT OF $1.1 BILLION.BLACKROCK INC - WILL NOT RECEIVE ANY OF PROCEEDS FROM SALE OF SHARES OF ITS COMMON STOCK BY PNC.'}